window.__T={"A": "a humble medieval human farming village of the southern hills of Lordaeron (World of Warcraft): half-timbered cottages with steep dark slate roofs", "B": "evenly spaced in one row with generous empty white space between them", "C": "a small chapel years after the massacre: burnt roofless cottages"};window.__E="Hand-painted 2D cut-out animation art for a dark fairy-tale retelling of World of Warcraft lore: stylized Warcraft proportions (chunky silhouettes, big hands and shoulders, oversized armor), hand-painted textures with visible brush strokes and paper grain, clean dark ink outlines; gothic HORROR mood in plague-blighted Lordaeron: ashen greys, sickly plague green and cold moonlight blue palette with a single warm candle-orange accent, long shadows, drifting fog, eerie atmosphere, strong depth. ";window.__C=[" No text, no letters, no numbers, no watermark, no logos."];window.__I=[[0, "Wide background at night of the main street of Darrowshire during a losing battle: a broken barricade torn apart, overturned burning carts, scattered shields and spears on the ground, a cottage roof on fire, thick green fog pouring in from the end of the street, orange firelight against cold blue night. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night: the crest of a hill above Darrowshire where a road comes over the top, storm clouds tearing open behind the hill and a column of warm golden holy light breaking through, the burning village small in the valley below on the left. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night of the village square of Darrowshire in the middle of a battle: the stone well, the chapel with its bell tower lit by fires, smashed barrels, a fallen Lordaeron banner (no letters), embers and smoke in the air, green fog at the edges. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night: a burning wooden chapel collapsing in the background with huge orange flames and black smoke, a muddy open yard in front covered with ash and broken weapons, a single dead tree on the left, sparks falling. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night: the broken wooden palisade gate of Darrowshire seen from inside the village, the gate doors smashed open, a wall of thick black smoke and sickly green mist pouring through the gate from outside, a dead crow on a post, torches knocked down and burning on the ground. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night of the village square of Darrowshire under a black sky with a swirling vortex of sickly green clouds above it, the chapel bell tower burning with eerie green flames, the stone well cracked, bodies hidden under fallen banners, cold green light everywhere. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night: a narrow cobbled lane of Darrowshire swallowed by a creeping darkness, black smoke and shadow tendrils crawling over the walls of the cottages, a single green-glowing window, the moon hidden, deep dark violet and plague-green tones. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night: a row of small half-timbered cottages of Darrowshire with closed wooden doors and shuttered windows with faint candlelight leaking through the cracks, green fog in the lane, a cat-sized dark gap under one door, the street empty and silent. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night seen from a dark hill: the whole village of Darrowshire burning in the valley below by the black lake, columns of smoke rising into a sickly green sky, the chapel tower in flames, dead trees silhouetted in the foreground. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background seen from straight above: an old dark wooden writing desk at night, a large OPEN blank leather-bound book in the centre with empty cream pages, a guttering candle in a brass holder, a quill and an ink pot, a few dried autumn leaves, a small rag doll at the edge, deep shadows at the borders. The pages are completely BLANK."], [0, "Wide background at a grey sunless dawn: a muddy road leading away from the smoking ruins of Darrowshire toward dark hills, deep wheel ruts and footprints in the mud, broken spears stuck in the ground, a dead tree with crows, drifting green mist, cold ashen colours. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background of a plague-ridden farmstead in the Western Plaguelands (World of Warcraft) on an overcast day: a large old rotting wooden barn with a sagging roof, a broken windmill, dead fields of sickly yellow grain, a rotten fence, a single tilted scarecrow, sickly green clouds. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night of the square of the ruins of Darrowshire, @A@, stone chimneys, wooden fences, @C@, broken black beams, collapsed fences, dead trees, the stone well cracked and dry, a burnt chapel without roof, weeds and ash, pale green ghostly mist, a cold moon. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night of a ruined street of the ruins of Darrowshire, @A@, stone chimneys, wooden fences, @C@, broken black beams, collapsed fences, dead trees, rubble and fallen beams across the street, a rusted helmet on the ground, blue-green ghostly mist flowing low between the ruins, faint will-o-wisp lights. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night: a small ruined half-timbered cottage standing alone at the edge of the ruins of Darrowshire, half of its roof gone, one window frame still whole with a faint cold blue light inside, a small broken fence and a dead apple tree in the yard, mist, a pale moon. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background on an overcast grey day in the Western Plaguelands (World of Warcraft): a lonely abandoned farmhouse on a low hill south of the ruined town of Andorhal (broken towers on the horizon), boarded windows, an overgrown yard, a broken cart, dead trees, sickly green-grey sky. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background inside a dusty abandoned farmhouse: broken chairs, a table covered in dust and cobwebs, a cold fireplace full of ash, an old portrait frame on the wall with the picture faded to nothing, pale grey daylight through broken shutters, floating dust. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty floor across the lower third. No people."], [0, "Wide background inside a small ruined cottage at night: a broken wooden table with two little stools, a child's straw bed in the corner, burnt beams above showing the night sky, a small cracked window with cold moonlight, ash on the floor, a little shelf with a cracked teapot and cups. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty floor across the lower third. No people."], [0, "Wide background at dusk seen from high above at an angle: the whole ruined village of Darrowshire below, burnt roofless cottages and lanes, the dry square with the well, the chapel ruins, the black lake at the edge, pale green mist pooling in the lanes, like an old painted map. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night seen from inside a ruined child's room: a broken window frame with cracked glass covered in white frost patterns, cold blue moonlight falling across the dusty floor, frost on the window sill, a small empty chair, breath-cold blue darkness. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty floor across the lower third. No people."], [0, "Wide background on an overcast day of the cemetery of the ruined town of Andorhal (World of Warcraft): rows of crooked gravestones and stone crosses, one taller weathered stone monument in the middle, an iron fence, dead trees, the broken towers of Andorhal behind, sickly green-grey sky and low mist. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background inside a ruined inn of Andorhal: half-collapsed wooden beams, a long table piled with old books, scrolls, maps and a golden hourglass, a few candles, a bar counter with broken bottles, a fallen chandelier, warm candle light mixed with cold grey light from a hole in the roof. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty floor across the lower third. No people."], [0, "Wide background inside the Caverns of Time (World of Warcraft): an immense sandy cavern with swirling golden sand in the air, giant floating hourglasses, glowing bronze-gold portals in the rock walls, sand dunes on the floor. Same art style but warm golden sand and bronze tones. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background inside the ruined town hall of Andorhal at night: tall bookshelves full of old books, some books floating in the air glowing with sickly purple-green light, scattered papers, a big cracked stone staircase, cobwebs, a broken stained-glass window. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty floor across the lower third. No people."], [0, "Wide background of Light's Hope Chapel (World of Warcraft) on a grey day: a white stone chapel with a tall bell tower on a hill in the Eastern Plaguelands, tents and banners of the Argent Dawn (no letters), a warm golden light glowing from the chapel door, the blighted land all around. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night: a dark still lake in the Western Plaguelands with dead reeds and black water, pale ghostly blue mist on the shore, broken weapons half sunk in the mud, a dead tree leaning over the water, the moon reflected. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background on a cold grey day of Hearthglen (World of Warcraft), the fortified town of the Scarlet Crusade: tall white stone walls and towers with crimson red banners (no letters), a heavy gate, a gallows, pine trees with snow patches, a stern cold atmosphere. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night of the ruined square of Darrowshire glowing with ghostly light: the cracked well in the middle, broken barricades still standing like in the old battle, the burnt chapel, pale blue-green spectral light rising from the ground, swirling mist. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at a cold pale dawn of the ruins of Darrowshire, @A@, stone chimneys, wooden fences, @C@, broken black beams, collapsed fences, dead trees, the first grey light on the broken roofs, thin mist, silent and empty, a single crow on a beam. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at a soft pale dawn: a small ruined half-timbered cottage at the edge of Darrowshire, the door frame still standing, a broken fence, a dead apple tree, a faint warm light glowing inside the window, mist lifting, the first pink light in the sky. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at dawn: the back yard behind a small ruined cottage, a crooked dead tree, a small patch of earth by the stone wall, broken barrels, a pale mist, soft pink-grey morning light. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night: the shore of the big lake Darrowmere with the ruins of Darrowshire on the hill above, a full moon and its long silver reflection on the still black water, reeds, a small broken wooden pier, a few faint ghostly lights over the water. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Wide background at night: the ruined cottage where a ghost girl waits, seen close from outside, a single window with one small candle burning on the sill and a little rag doll sitting next to it, cracked walls, ivy, mist. Strong depth: foreground, midground and background layers. Open empty ground across the lower third. No people, no animals."], [0, "Character model sheet on a plain flat pure white background: Davil Lightfire, a young blond human paladin of the Knights of the Silver Hand of World of Warcraft, clean-shaven, short blond hair, shining silver-and-gold plate armour with big round pauldrons, a white tabard with a golden emblem, a kite shield and a warhammer glowing with golden holy light. The SAME man drawn 6 times, full body, @B@, never touching or overlapping: raising his glowing warhammer high and shouting a rallying cry; swinging the warhammer in a mighty blow; bracing behind his shield; kneeling wounded clutching his side, hammer on the ground; lying on his back dying, side view, eyes closed; walking in full armour, side view facing right. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Character model sheet on a plain flat pure white background: Horgus the Ravager, a huge hulking ghoul lord of the Scourge of World of Warcraft: grey-green rotting muscular body twice the size of a man, a wild mane of long black hair, huge claws, exposed ribs and spine, torn loincloth, glowing green eyes, drooling jaws. The SAME monster drawn 5 times, full body, @B@, never touching or overlapping: stalking forward crouched; roaring with arms spread wide; slashing with his claws; falling backwards struck down; lying dead face down. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Character model sheet on a plain flat pure white background: Marduk the Black, a death knight of the Scourge of World of Warcraft: tall, in black spiked plate armour with bone-white trims, a horned black helmet hiding the face with two icy glowing eyes, a tattered black cape, a long dark runeblade glowing with icy green runes. The SAME knight drawn 5 times, full body, @B@, never touching or overlapping: standing pointing his runeblade forward; holding out one clawed gauntlet casting swirling dark green-violet magic; laughing with arms spread wide; walking side view facing right; holding up his shattered broken runeblade. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Animation sprite sheet on a plain flat pure white background: gallop cycle of Marduk the Black, a death knight in black spiked armour and tattered black cape riding a skeletal undead warhorse with glowing green eyes and green flames at its hooves. The SAME horse and rider drawn 6 times in a single horizontal row, strict side view facing right, same size, evenly spaced and not touching, each drawing a consecutive phase of one gallop stride. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Character model sheet on a plain flat pure white background: Redpath the Corrupted of World of Warcraft, the twisted undead shadow of a village captain: a broad bearded man with a longsword and a round shield, but his body made of dark smoky shadow, translucent black and plague-green, glowing sickly green eyes, green wisps trailing from his armour. The SAME figure drawn 5 times, full body, @B@, never touching or overlapping: standing menacing with sword and shield; shouting with arms spread wide; reaching out a clawed hand spreading green corruption; collapsing to his knees struck down; dissolving upward into black smoke. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Character model sheet on a plain flat pure white background: Chromie, a tiny female gnome of World of Warcraft (a bronze dragon in disguise): pale blonde hair in two short pigtails, big green eyes, white and gold robes with bronze pauldrons, a golden staff topped with a small hourglass. The SAME gnome drawn 5 times, full body, @B@, never touching or overlapping: sitting on a stack of books reading; leaning forward squinting curiously; pointing up with one finger explaining; holding out a tied cloth bundle with both arms; raising her staff casting golden time magic with sand swirling. Then a sixth separate drawing of a bronze dragon with golden-bronze scales and cream wings, flying, side view facing right. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Character model sheet on a plain flat pure white background: a World of Warcraft adventurer, a human warrior in steel plate armour with a red cloak and a longsword. The SAME man drawn 6 times, full body, @B@, never touching or overlapping: walking side view facing right; kneeling and digging in the ground with his hands; swinging his sword in a strike; holding a small object up in one hand; standing still listening, head tilted; crouching to place a cloth bundle on the ground. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Animation sprite sheet on a plain flat pure white background: run cycle of Pamela Redpath, a little human girl of about 7 with long ginger-red hair in two side ponytails, brown peasant dress with a cream-white apron, barefoot, running with her arms open. The SAME girl drawn 8 times in a single horizontal row, strict side view facing right, full body, same size and same height, evenly spaced with wide gaps and not touching, each drawing a consecutive phase of one running stride. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Character sheet on a plain flat pure white background: Captain Joseph Redpath (broad man, brown beard, steel breastplate, blue and gold sash) and his little daughter Pamela (7, ginger-red ponytails, brown dress, cream apron), full body, @B@, never touching or overlapping: Joseph kneeling and hugging Pamela tightly; Joseph and Pamela walking away hand in hand seen from behind; Pamela jumping with joy with her arms up; Pamela holding a small teapot carefully; Pamela holding out a small brass key with both hands; Joseph kneeling with his arms open wide. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Character sheet on a plain flat pure white background: 6 different figures of the Plaguelands of World of Warcraft, full body, @B@, never touching or overlapping: a decrepit guardian, an undead skeletal librarian in rotten purple robes holding a glowing book; a Scarlet Crusade soldier in a white tabard with a red emblem, red cape and sword; a Scarlet Crusade archer; a huge stitched undead abomination with hooks; a floating pale banshee with long white hair; a plague-ridden peasant zombie with a scythe. No ground, no cast shadows."], [0, "Prop sheet on a plain flat pure white background, 16 separate objects evenly spaced in a 4x4 grid, never touching or overlapping: the head of a small rag doll with button eyes and red yarn hair; the torn left half of the rag doll's body; the torn right half of the rag doll's body; a simple gold wedding ring; an old thick leather-bound book with brass corners; a huge monstrous ghoul skull with long fangs; a broken black runeblade sword with icy green runes; a rolled parchment treatise tied with a red ribbon and a wax seal; a cloth bundle of relics tied with rope; a small blue ceramic teapot; a tea cup; a small sugar bowl; a brass key; a small wooden treasure chest with iron bands; a golden hourglass; a brown leather bag with a drawstring. No ground, no cast shadows."]];window.__P=(i)=>{const [c,t]=window.__I[i];return window.__E+t.replace(/@([A-Za-z])@/g,(m,x)=>window.__T[x])+window.__C[c]};window.__ins=async(i)=>{await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,3500));const ed=document.querySelector('.ProseMirror');ed.focus();document.execCommand('selectAll');document.execCommand('delete');document.execCommand('insertText',false,window.__P(i));return ed.innerText.length};window.__seen=new Set([...document.querySelectorAll('img')].filter(i=>i.src.includes('flow-content')).map(i=>i.src.split('?')[0]));window.__col=async(n)=>{const t0=Date.now();let o=[];while(Date.now()-t0<55000){o=[...document.querySelectorAll('img')].filter(i=>i.src.includes('flow-content')).map(i=>i.src).filter(u=>!window.__seen.has(u.split('?')[0]));if(o.length>=n)break;await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,2000));}o.reverse();o.forEach(u=>window.__seen.add(u.split('?')[0]));return o.map(u=>{const m=u.match(/image\/([0-9a-f-]+)\?Expires=(\d+)&KeyName=[^&]+&Signature=(.+)$/);return m?m[1]+' '+m[2]+' '+m[3]:u}).join('\n')};